# Keeps the build context to source + manifests. node_modules is reinstalled
# inside the image from the lockfile (`npm ci`), and .next is rebuilt — both
# would otherwise be copied in only to be overwritten, and a host-built
# .next can carry platform-specific binaries that break in the image.
node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.tsbuildinfo
test
